          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Heavenly Sixteen All-In-One Face Oil is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_biepnb": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can Heavenly 16 All-In-One Face Oil be used on top of actives?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Heavenly 16 All-In-One Face Oil can be used on top of actives.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_RiEp8F": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why should I be using a face oil?",
            "content": "<p>There are so many benefits to using Heavenly 16 All-In-One Face Oil, including moisture retention, binding moisture to the skin, plumping and helping boost skin’s elasticity.<br/><br/>Face oils can help protect your skin barrier as well as sealing in the benefits of all of your skincare products. <br/><br/>Face oils also prevent moisture from evaporating from your skin (think of them as a ‘saran wrap’ for your skin).</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_HGmztw": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Heavenly 16 All-In-One Face Oil in other places than my face?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Heavenly 16 All-In-One Face Oil can be used on any area where you feel especially dry. Remember a small amount goes a long way!</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
